  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:** (First number - 1) × (Second number +1) = Third Number.**\n\nFor, (21, 5, 120)\n\n(21 - 1) × (5 + 1) = 120\n\n20 × 6 = 120\n\n120 = 120.\n\nFor, (2, 7, 8)\n\n(2 - 1) × (7 + 1) = 8\n\n1 × 8 = 8\n\n8 = 8.\n\nLet's check each option One by One:\n\n**Option 1) (3, 4,10)**\n\n(3 - 1) × (4 + 1) = 10\n\n2 × 5 = 10\n\n**10 = 10.**\n\nOption 2) (3, 4, 16)\n\n(3 - 1) × (4 + 1) = 16\n\n2 × 5 \n\n10 ≠16.\n\nOption 3) (2, 6, 21)\n\n(2 - 1) × (6 + 1) = 21\n\n1 × 7 \n\n7 ≠ 21.\n\nOption 4) (4, 7, 34)\n\n(4 - 1) × (7 + 1)\n\n4 × 8\n\n32 ≠ 34.\n\nHence, the correct answer is*** 'Option 1'.***",
